      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Every valid \\(X\\) contains \\(1,2,\\) while each of \\(3,4,5\\) may be chosen independently. Hence there are \\[ 2^3=8 \\] possible sets.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
